rs/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T07:01:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T06:38:34Z","body":"Bisected to #68576 . @Maran23 \n\nIt's this section specifically that is breaking it, if I comment out this it fixes the regression:\n```\n// ENSURE_WIDTH may create a new line. In this case we are at the beginning and don't want to shift the initial text.\nif (line_is_blank) {\n\tspacing_char = 0;\n}\n```\nI'm guessing this is somehow bypassing a check for a newline maybe.\n\nUPDATE:\nI did have a little look at this yesterday but the logic for the layout seems pretty complex and prone to regressions, and I'm not having the time to devote to this right at the moment.\n\n@Maran23 do let me know if you can whether you are able to work on this. If not, we can revert it until someone has time to work on this properly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146279193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3224968961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108890#issuecomment-3224968961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108890","id":3224968961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AOR8B","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/l